Optimize this Python function for better performance. The current implementation is O(n²), can you make it O(n log n) or better?

```python
def find_duplicates(arr):
    duplicates = []
    for i in range(len(arr)):
        for j in range(i + 1, len(arr)):
            if arr[i] == arr[j] and arr[i] not in duplicates:
                duplicates.append(arr[i])
    return duplicates
```

